      "math_academy_id": "e-4402",
      "problem": "Find $AB$, if \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14273053/assets/9da156285e4971fcbae4819757071428832d02be04f610a75db9b4db90e2c626.svg)\nand\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14273053/assets/7e31d9ebd53606e1149226eecda636899ba3ad4b94fb0662796480644cf49525.svg)",
      "worked_solution": "Multiplying each row in the first matrix by each column in the second, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -1 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 4 \\\\ -3 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0+0-9 & -6+0-3 & 4+0+6 \\\\ 0-1+6 & 9+2+2 & -6-4-4 \\\\ 0+0+3 & -6+0+1 & 4+0-2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-9 & -9 & 10 \\\\ 5 & 13 & -14 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
